{"v":4,"catch":"準備好在 Euro Car Parking Simulator 2025 中迎接終極駕駛挑戰吧！","desc":"本遊戲提供大量刺激的城市停車關卡，還有在特別競技場內進行的技術測試，玩家需要駕駛穿越各種障礙，才能成功停車。\n\n遊戲中有多款不同類型的車輛可供選擇，從靈巧的小型車到強力的跑車應有盡有。每一台車都配備精心設計的真實駕駛物理系統，讓你感受到逼真的操控體驗。\n\n想暫時放下停車任務？你可以在開放式城市中自由駕駛，享受流暢又真實的駕駛手感。\n\n無論你是停車高手，還是熱愛真實駕駛遊戲的玩家，Euro Car Parking Simulator 2025 都會讓你愛不釋手！","publisher":"Evgheni Carasiov","release":"2025-04-24","genres":["模擬","競速","運動","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","俄文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 2.1GB / Switch 2.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/afc793178f1740409a9e3dbbf1c4ff9b761a5010c7e74a0c89d3eafdf57c23a0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c7cc8e3015b9d0a6a09dda50f48be1cd5d77bad467e593e26e55793cd0421a9c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f8f3e0bb356fd517c09c134a2e2b555b23d3832327ba5698258be89bdec19ba8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d67c65b6a0ba44604c02d39bd1f33b0ada2caf09f4b73e47b1270885342426d4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/370a8d5b2e756c4d9a866919b14924dfd8e093f45b10de38a93d39cd704aed77.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/513e74f659291b1151355cca27794644095662c35dad3a79c9a86f8e69dc2938.jpg"],"titleId":"0100aeb02316e000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000074011","name":"Euro Car Parking: Retro Vehicle Pack","img":"fa627f474cbe1a7bfb61cf96ae067a77fa5d568587a2669664e0c5f9c57c1e4d","date":"2026-06-18","mem":false}]}